n</div>\n<!-- Outer table starts here -->\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; border-collapse: collapse;margin:0 auto;\" width=\"100%\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#fbfbfb\" class=\"bg-black\" style=\"background-color:#fbfbfb;\">\n\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"main\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; margin:0 auto;min-width:600px;\" width=\"600\">\n\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#fbfbfb\" class=\"bg-black\" style=\"background-color:#fbfbfb;\"><!-- Logo Module -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"logo-module\" pardot-removable=\"Logo Module\" pardot-repeatable=\"Logo Module\" style=\"width: 100%;margin: 0 auto;border-spacing: 0;border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" class=\"bg-black\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"inner_table\" style=\"width:560px;margin:0 auto;\" width=\"560\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td height=\"15\" style=\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div pardot-region=\"Logo\" pardot-region-type=\"Logo\" pardot-removable=\"Logo\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"https://go.otava.com/e/1092582/ampaign-managed-cloud-services/n1sv6/1782797867/h/KDUzIkTi7mcW-FPYx64h0p30F3Lgat6DsgO3aZvnOgQ\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://go.otava.com/l/1092582/2025-05-13/lcmx7/1092582/1747138750NW7t96Iv/otava_logo1.png\" width=\"150\"></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td height=\"15\" style=\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Logo Module ends here --><!-- Heading and Text Module -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"head-text-module\" pardot-removable=\"Heading &amp; Text Module\" pardot-repeatable=\"Heading &amp; Text Module\" style=\"width: 100%;margin: 0 auto;border-spacing: 0;border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" class=\"bg-black\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"inner_table\" style=\"width:560px;margin:0 auto;\" width=\"560\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td height=\"10\" style=\"line-height:1px;font-size:1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"text_white\" style=\"vertical-align:top;color:#1f3a60;font-weight:400;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;font-family:Manrope,Arial,sans-serif;\" valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div pardot-region=\"Text\" pardot-region-type=\"Text\" pardot-removable=\"Text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Hi Jishnu,</span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-ccp-border-between=\"0px none #000000\" data-ccp-padding-between=\"0px\" paraeid=\"{54c63c97-23f8-4185-bb5a-b383a7a8f212}{28}\" paraid=\"12\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">As more teams adopt multi-cloud strategies, managing performance, security, and costs across environments is becoming harder to navigate.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-ccp-border-between=\"0px none #000000\" data-ccp-border-bottom=\"0px none #000000\" data-ccp-padding-between=\"0px\" data-ccp-padding-bottom=\"0px\" paraeid=\"{54c63c97-23f8-4185-bb5a-b383a7a8f212}{30}\" paraid=\"13\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Without the right approach, multi-cloud infrastructure can lead to resource sprawl, inconsistent governance, and rising operational overhead that offsets the flexibility teams are aiming for.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-ccp-border-between=\"0px none #000000\" data-ccp-padding-between=\"0px\" paraeid=\"{54c63c97-23f8-4185-bb5a-b383a7a8f212}{32}\" paraid=\"14\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">If&nbsp;you’re&nbsp;evaluating how to simplify and scale your cloud strategy&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p paraeid=\"{54c63c97-23f8-4185-bb5a-b383a7a8f212}{34}\" paraid=\"320880978\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong>With OTAVA’s multi-cloud strategies, teams can:&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul role=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p paraeid=\"{54c63c97-23f8-4185-bb5a-b383a7a8f212}{36}\" paraid=\"1661196421\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Reduce complexity: simplify management across private, hybrid, and public environments&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul role=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552