    "text": "Simplify multi-cloud management while improving performance, security, and cost control.\n\nhttps://go.otava.com/e/1092582/ampaign-managed-cloud-services/n1sv6/1782797867/h/KDUzIkTi7mcW-FPYx64h0p30F3Lgat6DsgO3aZvnOgQ\n\nHi Jishnu,\n\nAs more teams adopt multi-cloud strategies, managing performance, security, and costs across environments is becoming harder to navigate. \n\nWithout the right approach, multi-cloud infrastructure can lead to resource sprawl, inconsistent governance, and rising operational overhead that offsets the flexibility teams are aiming for. \n\nIf you’re evaluating how to simplify and scale your cloud strategy \n\nWith OTAVA’s multi-cloud strategies, teams can: \n\nReduce complexity: simplify management across private, hybrid, and public environments \nImprove performance: maintain consistent performance across workloads \nStrengthen security &amp; compliance: enforce unified security policies \nControl costs: eliminate unexpected spend and improve long-term efficiency \n\nCheck out our suite of cloud services to see how teams are simplifying operations without adding overhead. \n\nExplore Solutions {https://go.otava.com/e/1092582/ampaign-managed-cloud-services/n1sv6/1782797867/h/KDUzIkTi7mcW-FPYx64h0p30F3Lgat6DsgO3aZvnOgQ}\n\nBest,\n-OTAVA\n\nhttps://go.otava.com/e/1092582/company-14060381/n1sv9/1782797867/h/KDUzIkTi7mcW-FPYx64h0p30F3Lgat6DsgO3aZvnOgQ\nhttps://go.otava.com/e/1092582/126445097387270/n1svd/1782797867/h/KDUzIkTi7mcW-FPYx64h0p30F3Lgat6DsgO3aZvnOgQ\nhttps://go.otava.com/e/1092582/OtavaLLC/n1svh/1782797867/h/KDUzIkTi7mcW-FPYx64h0p30F3Lgat6DsgO3aZvnOgQ\nhttps://go.otava.com/e/1092582/otavallc/n1svl/1782797867/h/KDUzIkTi7mcW-FPYx64h0p30F3Lgat6DsgO3aZvnOgQ\n\nOTAVA, 505 W Merrill St, Indianapolis, IN 46225 , 877.740.5028\nUnsubscribe\nhttps://go.otava.com/unsubscribe/u/1092582/04877dc6693dad22ccb50265b8391a61b397b7a69740b34baebad242aedc3feb/1782797867\nManage preferences\nhttps://go.otava.com/email-preference-center?ehash=0